## Course Requests

### Create a course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "1er Grado",
  "fee": 45000.00,
  "timetables": [
    {
      "days": "Mon,Wed",
      "startTime": "16:00",
      "endTime": "17:00"
    }
  ]
}


> {%
    client.global.set("courseId", response.body.id);
%}

### Get a course by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}

### Get all courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### Update Course
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "1er Grado",
  "fee": 50000.00,
  "timetables": [
    {
      "days": "Mon,Wed",
      "startTime": "16:00",
      "endTime": "17:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Delete Course (hard delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}